# Optional ONLY for separate Next dev server (npm run dev --prefix apps/web).
# Leave undefined when building the integrated single-Render deployment,
# so both the HTTP API and WebSocket use the current page's origin.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STACK_API_ORIGIN=https://your-trusted-backend.example
# Dev-only cross-origin use must be explicitly allowed by STACK_WEB_ORIGIN
# on that trusted game server.
